//! go-file: pkg/util/collate/collate.go
//!
//! Port of Go TiDB v8.5.8 `pkg/util/collate` (block D01.9): the collators of the new
//! collation framework, their `LIKE` patterns, and the collation name / ID helpers.
//!
//! Go strings are byte strings (`&[u8]`); invalid UTF-8 is handled exactly as Go does
//! (each collator has its own rule: stop, compare equal, or encode `?`). The weight tables
//! are generated by the tracker's `rsgen` from Go's data (`*_data.rs`, `ucadata/`).
//!
//! `Collator` and `WildcardPattern` are Go interfaces; here they are object-safe traits and
//! `GetCollator` returns a `&'static dyn Collator` from the registry that Go fills in
//! `init`.

